        </div>
    </header>

    <main>
        <!-- Hero Section -->
        <section class="hero">
            <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
            <div class="container hero-content">
                <h1>您的财富管家，您的成长伙伴</h1>
                <p>长川银行致力于为个人和小企业提供全面、安全、便捷的金融服务。无论您是储蓄、理财还是贷款，我们都在这里为您服务。</p>
                <a href="personal.html" class="btn btn-primary" style="padding: 12px 30px; font-size: 16px;">查看服务</a>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Features -->
        <section>
            <div class="container">
                <div class="section-title">
                    <h2>为什么选择长川银行</h2>
                    <p>我们以客户为中心，依托先进的金融科技和严格的风控体系，为您守护每一分财富。</p>
                </div>
                <div class="services-grid">
                    <div class="service-card">
                        <div class="service-icon">🔒</div>
                        <h3>资金安全</h3>
                        <p>银行级资金存管体系，全天候智能监控，全方位保障您的账户安全。</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="service-card">
                        <div class="service-icon">⚡</div>
                        <h3>高效便捷</h3>
                        <p>手机银行极速开户，大额转账秒到账，让金融服务触手可及。</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="service-card">
                        <div class="service-icon">💰</div>
                        <h3>灵活理财</h3>
                        <p>提供活期、定期及大额存单等多种产品，满足您不同的资产配置需求。</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="service-card">
                        <div class="service-icon">🏦</div>
                        <h3>线下网点</h3>
                        <p>覆盖全国主要城市的线下服务网点，为您提供专业的面对面咨询服务。</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Statistics -->
        <section class="stats">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="stats-grid">
                    <div class="stat-item">
                        <h3>12,000+</h3>
                        <p>全国服务网点</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-item">
                        <h3>5000万+</h3>
                        <p>累计服务客户</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-item">
                        <h3>¥8,000亿</h3>
                        <p>管理资产规模</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-item">
                        <h3>3.8%</h3>
                        <p>平均理财产品收益</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Featured Products -->
        <section>
            <div class="container">
                <div class="section-title">
                    <h2>热门产品推荐</h2>
                </div>
                <div class="products-grid">
                    <div class="product-card">
                        <img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/loans/400/300" alt="个人贷款">
                        <div class="product-overlay">
                            <h3>长川薪金贷</h3>
                            <p>最高可贷50万，随借随还，专为职场新人打造</p>
